          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimanda malaikaiyatab Jehovah kemounoto, ak kobar bik elfusiek bogol ak tamanwogik sisiit ak mut eng’ nganasetab Asuriek: ak kingong’eetyo bik karon, ogeero, ki muswek tugul, che kogobek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwo anyun Senakerib laitoriatab Asuria, koweek ak kwo komeny Ninebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kita kosaei eng’ gotab Nisrok kanamwennyi, kobar inendet Adramelek ak Sareser eng’ rotwetab chok: ak komwei koba emetab Ararat. Ak kilaitoran Esarhadon werinnyi kogeer inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.37"
            ]
